==French==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fr|frm|moins}}, from {{inh|fr|fro|meins}}, from {{inh|fr|la|minus}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{fr-IPA}}

===Adverb===
{{fr-adv}}

# [[less]], [[fewer]]
#: {{ux|fr|Faites '''moins''' de bruit.|Make less noise.|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|fr|J'ai dû attendre '''moins''' de dix minutes.|I had to wait '''less''' than ten minutes.|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|fr|De '''moins''' en '''moins''' de personnes peuvent se permettre de passer des vacances à l'étranger.|Fewer and fewer people can afford to spend holidays abroad.}}
# {{lb|fr|with numbers}} [[minus]]; [[negative]]
#: {{ux|fr|'''moins''' cinq|minus five|inline=1}}
# {{lb|fr|preceded by a [[definite article]]}} the [[least]]
#: {{ux|fr|C'est lui qui gagne le '''moins''' (d'argent) dans sa famille.|He earns the least money in his family.|incline=1}}
#: {{ux|fr|C'était la chose la '''moins''' surprenante.|It was the least surprising thing.|incline=1}}

